  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Assistance alimentaire et nutritionnelle d&#x2019;urgence aux populations touch&#xe9;es par les crises dans les r&#xe9;gions de l&apos;Extr&#xea;me Nord du Cameroun</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of this project is to provide [sectors] assistance to internally displaced persons, refugees, returnees and host community members in the Far North region of Cameroon. This WFP project provides in-kind food assistance, distributes $342,000 in cash assistance, provides nutritional support to children .The food security component of this project provides humanitarian assistance to 30,000 people, including 12,900 women, 9,900 men, 7,200 children, and including 4,500 persons with disabilities. The nutrition component of this project provides humanitarian assistance to 16,000 children,  including 2,400 persons with disabilities.</narrative>
  </description>
